00:22:25.778 --> 00:22:28.681
Taclesspec!

00:22:32.117 --> 00:22:33.552
It's all over...

00:22:34.019 --> 00:22:36.622
The technical combo,
Imperial Purveyor Taclesspec!

00:22:36.622 --> 00:22:38.991
What kind of communication is that?

00:22:38.991 --> 00:22:39.592
Drop it.

00:22:40.559 --> 00:22:41.594
And clutch!

00:22:41.794 --> 00:22:44.830
You're not using the spectacles?
You're not actually going to use it?

00:22:44.830 --> 00:22:46.632
Taclesspec!

00:22:48.767 --> 00:22:51.136
Taclesspec is no more
than a simple word.

00:22:52.037 --> 00:22:56.141
Does this mean your taclesspec
is higher than my taclesspec?

00:22:56.141 --> 00:22:58.544
Fist of the Nose Hair
Secret Technique:

00:22:58.544 --> 00:22:59.345
Hell Shrike Drop!

00:22:59.345 --> 00:23:00.813
Fist of the Nose Hair Secret Technique:
Hell Shrike Drop! Hell Shrike Drop!

