It's a draw!

00:23:06.151 --> 00:23:06.218
She's back!

00:23:06.218 --> 00:23:07.286
Beauty's back!
She's back!

00:23:07.386 --> 00:23:09.121
That's as far as you'll get!

00:23:10.489 --> 00:23:16.161
We'll end this with Z-Block's
newest tank model, the P365!

00:23:16.595 --> 00:23:17.696
A tank?

00:23:21.567 --> 00:23:23.335
There's someone weird riding it, though!

00:23:23.335 --> 00:23:24.970
No!

00:23:25.905 --> 00:23:28.807
They're in deep fear of the tank, Captain.

00:23:28.807 --> 00:23:31.110
Let's give them dengaku, nah-la!

00:23:31.110 --> 00:23:32.912
But before that...

00:23:33.212 --> 00:23:34.613
We kill 'em!

00:23:36.181 --> 00:23:37.983
<i>Z-Block's secret weapon...</i>

00:23:37.983 --> 00:23:39.985
has arrived without warning.

00:23:40.586 --> 00:23:44.323
Do Bo-bobo and his
friends stand a chance?

00:23:44.757 --> 00:23:46.592
Is service time already over?

00:23:46.592 --> 00:23:49.595
And where is Hatenko hiding!?

00:24:00.239 --> 00:24:04.543
When the cherry
blossoms bloom, I remember...

00:24:04.543 --> 00:24:10.149
...the gentle dawn that
will never come back.

00:24:11.517 --> 00:24:15.854
| used to wish I would be hurt,

00:24:15.854 --> 00:24:22.494
because I thought being
hurt would make me happy.

00:24:22.494 --> 00:24:25.497
I lost things and broke things...

00:24:25.497 --> 00:24:27.967
I understood so many things

00:24:27.967 --> 00:24:33.839
This year the cherry
blossoms will sway too!

00:24:33.839 --> 00:24:41.046
My hazy feelings will
disappear with the wind.

00:24:42.281 --> 00:24:45.050
What was I drawing again...

00:24:45.050 --> 00:24:47.953
...that had so much hate in it?

00:24:47.953 --> 00:24:51.190
How many times will I go in circles...

00:24:51.824 --> 00:24:53.492
...before I understand
what weakness is?

00:24:53.492 --> 00:24:56.261
I'm struggling and crying again,

00:24:56.261 --> 00:24:59.398
but that doesn't mean
I can't keep going!

00:25:00.232 --> 00:25:02.434
To the future ahead of us

00:25:11.810 --> 00:25:14.279
Bobobo-bo Bo-bobo

00:25:14.880 --> 00:25:17.082
Now we meet, Captain of the Z-Block!

00:25:17.216 --> 00:25:18.751
Dengakuman's so cute!

00:25:18.751 --> 00:25:20.919
Watch out! He's a wiggin' specialist!

00:25:20.919 --> 00:25:22.721
Then we'll have a
wiggin' out showdown...

00:25:22.721 --> 00:25:24.556
So then it's going to turn
out like it always does...

00:25:24.556 --> 00:25:26.558
But this guy has some kind of secret!

00:25:26.625 --> 00:25:28.994
Is it that he's something
from somewhere?

00:25:29.061 --> 00:25:30.863
Yes, yes. He's something
from somewhere.

00:25:30.863 --> 00:25:33.165
Hey, don't be so cryptic!
Tell me already!

00:25:33.165 --> 00:25:34.733
